## Design System Defaults

These are Kadeio's baseline standards. Override per project based on vibe.

### Typography Approach
- Always pair a **display/heading font** with a **body font** — never use a single font for both
- Avoid: Inter, Roboto, Arial, system-ui as primary choices
- Favor: editorial, characterful, or unexpected pairings
- Load via Google Fonts CDN in `<head>`

### Color Philosophy
- Commit to a **dominant palette** (2–3 colors max) + 1 sharp accent
- Define in `:root` as variables:
```css
:root {
  --color-bg: ;
  --color-surface: ;
  --color-primary: ;
  --color-accent: ;
  --color-text: ;
  --color-text-muted: ;
}
```

### Spacing System
```css
:root {
  --space-xs: 0.5rem;
  --space-sm: 1rem;
  --space-md: 2rem;
  --space-lg: 4rem;
  --space-xl: 8rem;
}
```

### Motion Principles
- Entrance animations: staggered fade/slide on scroll
- Hover states: always present, never jarring
- No animation for animation's sake — every motion has purpose

