## Webflow Handoff Notes

When preparing for Webflow:
- Structure HTML sections to map 1:1 with Webflow sections/divs
- Name classes clearly (`.hero-wrapper`, `.nav-link`, `.cta-section`)
- Avoid deeply nested divs — Webflow builds better with flat-ish structure
- Flag any interactions that need Webflow Interactions 2.0 vs CSS-only

